/* redis-server is the plan of the unit.d/redis component. fab resolves every
   unit's plan together with this one, so it is not named here. */

/* the command line client: the appliance talks to its own server over
   loopback, the first boot hook proves the declared secret with it, and
   `keel inspect` reads this machine's role with it. redis-server depends on
   redis-tools at its own version, so this line adds no package; it says that
   this layer needs the client, the way keel-mariadb names mariadb-client. */
redis-tools

